{"id": "De9Wl7KSH6W", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Tum se tum tak ye laagi lagan… saari raat taare likhte rahe, aur har baar sirf tumhara chehra bana 🌙\n\nHaveli ki chhat par mehfil saji thi, par jiske liye woh gaa raha tha, uski gaddi khaali thi.\nUski har line aasmaan mein sone ke taaron se likhi gayi… aur saare taare jud kar ek hi chehra ban gaye: uska.\nWoh chehra jal utha, aur raat bhar woh neeche baag mein ek qabar khodta raha.\nAakhri diya bujha… aur us diye ki aakhri chingari upar uth kar uski aankh ban gayi ✨\n\n🎵 Tum Se Tum Tak · @niyamszn \n\nUsko bhejo jiski wajah se tumhara poora aasmaan bas ek hi chehra ban gaya hai\n\nTum Se Tum Tak | Tum Se Tum Tak song | sad love song Hindi | ghazal reel | Hindi song lyrics | animated lyrics | Mughal miniature painting | Pahari painting animation | starry night mehfil | heartbreak song | Indian miniature art\n\n#TumSeTumTak #MiniaturePainting #HindiLyrics #Ghazal #SadSongs", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1793020117, "like_count": 272, "comment_count": 1, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1620552423136701a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.549, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQP9jtbztyBjzZUXTchAgazZUB9b7tIYqJ_TXK5xZeUDFVyxwLykxwnMrTD5T447R36QcBDDelZrqUBUKf9Rbn4XCIysa3ssqUwXBdA.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdoD0w4oQGdhbESwbFDdBuG1ohNjUqoe4LOUFzdsM1fI-FTQx2VE3_agFvqrvTVRJkLq4VpIlQIX-nSRazxBHA3c&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=8Jc3DJNql_oQ7kNvwGb0Shd&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=G2InlRgu3ZpVCJE4KHEvsw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSjO_UWVAkMcBWAfzUBtuskte0tDiH-BBCcps1Y_2jr9w&oe=6AF42856", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "vide